# Graph workflow
When the user invokes @graph:
- For trivial single-file tasks, use one implementation node plus local quality checks; skip planner and reviewer agents.
- Initialize a run, or resume the latest incomplete run when requested.
- Record planning, implementation, checks, review, and synthesis nodes.
- Check the local content cache before any avoidable model call.
- Run local quality gates before model reviewers.
- Retry only failed nodes and dependent nodes, maximum twice.
- Cache successful reusable node outputs.
- Keep the local HTML graph updated and report its path at completion.
- Commit only with explicit user permission.
